   "id": "pa",
   "label": "pa-",
   "meaning": "un-, without",
   "summary": "Negates a word: fund (end) → pafund (endless), dukshëm (visible) → padukshëm (invisible).",
   "note": "pa is also the preposition 'without' (pa ty = without you). Many words just start with pa- by chance: palloj (to beat) has nothing to do with lloj.",
